{
  "baseline": [
    {
      "id": "toaster-01",
      "section": "Intro",
      "text": "Who owns your toaster? Who owns your toast?",
      "claim": "power",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-02",
      "section": "Intro",
      "text": "The power company? Not even close.",
      "claim": "power",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-03",
      "section": "Verse",
      "text": "You pay for the current, it runs through the wire,",
      "claim": "power",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-04",
      "section": "Verse",
      "text": "You choose what to cook, how long, how high the fire.",
      "claim": "power",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-05",
      "section": "Verse",
      "text": "Now plug in a model, put thought on the line,",
      "claim": "power",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-06",
      "section": "Verse",
      "text": "The spark comes from them, but the setup is mine.",
      "claim": "ownership",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-07",
      "section": "Verse",
      "text": "My context, my projects, my rules in a stack,",
      "claim": "memory",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-08",
      "section": "Verse",
      "text": "My files on the table, my checks bring me back.",
      "claim": "memory",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-09",
      "section": "Verse",
      "text": "A model can reason, but that is one part,",
      "claim": "power",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-10",
      "section": "Verse",
      "text": "The harness connects it to work from the start.",
      "claim": "memory",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-11",
      "section": "Chorus",
      "text": "Who owns your toaster? Who owns your toast?",
      "claim": "power",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-12",
      "section": "Chorus",
      "text": "You pay for the power\u2014you still own the toast.",
      "claim": "power",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-13",
      "section": "Chorus",
      "text": "Keep your context. Keep your keys.",
      "claim": "ownership",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-14",
      "section": "Chorus",
      "text": "Build your system. Make it yours.",
      "claim": "ownership",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-15",
      "section": "Verse",
      "text": "Observe what is missing, then plan what to try,",
      "claim": "cycles",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-16",
      "section": "Verse",
      "text": "Execute, verify\u2014show how and why.",
      "claim": "cycles",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-17",
      "section": "Verse",
      "text": "Condense what you learned so the next run can grow,",
      "claim": "cycles",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-18",
      "section": "Verse",
      "text": "A job has a trail, not just words in a flow.",
      "claim": "cycles",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-19",
      "section": "Verse",
      "text": "A prompt is a start, put the work in a place,",
      "claim": "memory",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-20",
      "section": "Verse",
      "text": "With feedback and files, give the task a clear shape.",
      "claim": "memory",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-21",
      "section": "Verse",
      "text": "Change out the model? Check what still fits,",
      "claim": "ownership",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-22",
      "section": "Verse",
      "text": "Keep the learned context, then test what you switch.",
      "claim": "ownership",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-23",
      "section": "Bridge",
      "text": "Raw energy. Raw reasoning.",
      "claim": "power",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "toaster-24",
      "section": "Bridge",
      "text": "Your structure gives the spark a meaning.",
      "claim": "memory",
      "origin": "agent_draft"
    },
